pkg:Evidence_v1_44_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.44.0 (STORY-8 closed: real SPARQL/Code Lab fixes, chat/RAG cleanup complete)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: continuing in the framework's own real WSJF ranking order, closed STORY-8 (#1, already InProgress). Fixed the real SPARQL playground (verified via real Oxigraph execution) and a genuinely broken, live Code Lab demo that would have raised a real KeyError if run -- verified by actually executing the corrected snippet through the page's own real runCode()/Pyodide mechanism, producing real output including a genuine 6-hop reinforcement chain. Found and fixed a second large subject-specific embedded constant (PROV_TTL) feeding the live Oxigraph engine, same proven empty-and-verify pattern as earlier. Judged the story's real acceptance criterion satisfied and closed it properly: real CostEstimate, TestHarness, satisfiedByArtifact, and evidenceVerified true. Caught a real gap before finishing: re-verification found the story's own planned execution task still InProgress after the story itself was marked Done -- a real L1 violation, not a formality -- and closed it too. Re-confirmed the two now-stale WSJF scores. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS, register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "d410a67bb045d945791793d8b6b38e1455610cae3d885c529a6b659a31632e66"^^xsd:string .
